    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP. Use it in your own Movement phase or Charge phase on one WORLD EATERS POSSESSED unit of yours that has not been picked, this phase, to move or to declare a charge. Until the phase ends, its models can pass through enemy models that are not MONSTERS or VEHICLES whenever they make a Normal move, an Advance, a Fall Back move or a Charge move. They may cross into Engagement Range of those models while doing so, but only a Charge move may end within their Engagement Range, and any Desperate Escape test is passed automatically.",
